{
 "_provenance": {
  "kind": "captured_from_real_software",
  "statement": "Captured from a real Bambuddy instance run locally in Docker by the session that wrote this file, seeded through Bambuddy's own documented REST API. This is evidence about Bambuddy, not about any printer and not about anyone's spools.",
  "bambuddy_version": "1.2.5.3",
  "image": "ghcr.io/maziggy/bambuddy:latest",
  "image_digest": "sha256:c670164aaa3b0c5af715ca00e9745cdf3a4d7d337fc11d96fc85180371952698",
  "captured": "2026-08-28",
  "endpoint": "GET /api/v1/inventory/spools?include_archived=true",
  "auth": "none - a fresh Bambuddy with no account created answers unauthenticated; X-API-Key is an optional header on every route",
  "what_it_proved": [
   "Archived spools are omitted from the default listing, exactly as Spoolman omits them: 10 spools with include_archived=true, 9 without. A slot mapped to an archived spool would otherwise read as deleted.",
   "There is no remaining-weight field at all. SpoolResponse carries label_weight and weight_used; the remaining figure is arithmetic Studio has to do itself, so it can never be presented as something Bambuddy is keeping.",
   "last_used is null on every spool here, including one whose weight was just set through the scale endpoint. It is written by print consumption only, so an undated figure is the common case rather than the edge - the same finding as Spoolman, reached through an entirely different schema.",
   "The scale endpoint writes weight_used and stamps last_weighed_at, so a weighed spool does carry a date on which its remaining figure was last true.",
   "Timestamps are naive ISO-8601 with no zone (2026-08-28T12:32:24.424192).",
   "The API accepts weight_used = -500, weight_used far above label_weight, and label_weight = 99000000. A provider will hand Studio impossible remaining weights, and it must fail to unknown rather than to 'enough'.",
   "It rejects a non-numeric weight, a null material, a malformed rgba and a Unicode-digit weight with HTTP 422, so those never reach Studio as data."
  ],
  "seeded_cases": {
   "1": "enough, weighed on a scale - label 1000, used 580, last_weighed_at set",
   "2": "clearly short, undated - label 1000, used 980",
   "3": "untouched spool, full declared kilogram, nothing recorded",
   "4": "a different material and vendor - PETG Matte, Prusament",
   "5": "a large but real spool - 5 kg",
   "6": "archived",
   "7": "impossible: negative used weight",
   "8": "impossible: used weight far above the label weight",
   "9": "impossible: 99000000 g label weight",
   "10": "no usable quantity: label weight 0"
  }
 },
